<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Case ID: {!relatedTo.CaseNumber} - Resolution provided for your Ask Commissions case" recipientType="User" relatedToType="Case">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<apex:image id="Logo" value="https://intel--crmdevcase--c.cs92.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153F000000F2QC&oid=00D3F0000000Nmr&lastMod=1543355524000" />
<apex:slds />
<br/>
A Commissions Office Admin has provided a resolution to your case. 
<br/> <br/>  <br/>   
    Case Id       : {!relatedTo.CaseNumber} <br/>
    Status        : {!relatedTo.Status} 
    <br/><br/><br/>

<b>Click the link below to view the resolution in the “Commissions Case Comments” section.  Add a new Case Comment to acknowledge resolution, or to ask clarifying questions.</b>

<br/><br/> 

<apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+relatedTo.Id}">{!relatedTo.CaseNumber}</apex:outputlink>

<br/><br/><br/>

<b>Please click below link to close this case :</b> <br/>

<br/>

<apex:outputLink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+'apex/Core_AAQC_Case_Close_Onemail?Caseid='+relatedTo.Id}"> 
Close this case
</apex:outputlink>

<br/><br/><br/>
If no response/Case Comment is received from you within 3-5 business days of this email we will send you one, follow up email.  If no response/Case Comment is received within 5 business days of the follow up email the case will be closed automatically. 
<br/> <br/> <br/>
***NOTE: Do not reply to this mail as there is no inbox being monitored***
<br/><br/><br/><br/>    
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>